      "writtenOn": "2021-01-09T08:22:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In general BB retimer function calls should not return error instead print warning message by sending return as Success. Retimer init we need to add extra delay so that virtual mux get a chance to configure the disconnect mode. Please refer the following scenario:\nEx.: 2 monitor case \nConnect type C port 0 and port 1 with typecDp or HDMI dongles \nCheck display\nEnter S0ix\nunplug the type C above devices\nswap the devices\nwake the system\nDisplay won\u0027t come in one port.",
